# EverShop Extensions Quick Reference

Essential patterns for building EverShop extensions. For full guide, see `docs/EVERSHOP-MODULES-EXTENSIONS-WIDGETS-THEMES.md`.

---

## Extension vs Core Module

| Aspect          | Core Module           | Extension              |
|-----------------|-----------------------|------------------------|
| Location        | `node_modules/`       | `extensions/*/src/`    |
| Editable        | ❌ No                 | ✅ Yes                 |
| Lifecycle       | Always active         | Enable/disable via config |
| Version Control | Platform              | Your repository        |

---

## Setup

### 1. Workspace Config

Add to root `package.json`:

```json
{
  "workspaces": [
    "extensions/*"
  ]
}
```

### 2. Extension Structure

```
extensions/my_feature/
├── src/
│   ├── api/              # REST endpoints
│   ├── pages/            # SSR pages
│   ├── services/         # Business logic
│   ├── graphql/          # GraphQL (optional)
│   ├── migration/        # Database changes
│   └── bootstrap.ts      # Initialization
├── package.json
└── tsconfig.json
```

### 3. package.json

```json
{
  "name": "my_feature",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "type": "module",
  "scripts": {
    "compile": "tsc && copyfiles -u 1 \"src/**/*.{graphql,scss,json}\" dist"
  }
}
```

### 4. Enable in Config

```json
// config/default.json
{
  "system": {
    "extensions": [
      {
        "name": "my_feature",
        "resolve": "extensions/my_feature",
        "enabled": true,
        "priority": 10
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

**Priority:** Lower number loads first (1 before 10)

---

## Naming Conventions

✅ **Valid:**
- `my_feature`
- `vendor_payment`
- `custom_shipping_v2`

❌ **Invalid:**
- `MyFeature` (no uppercase)
- `my-feature` (no hyphens)
- `my.feature` (no dots)

**Recommendation:** Use `vendor_feature` prefix to avoid conflicts

