## Publishing Extension

### 1. Prepare

```json
// package.json
{
  "name": "@vendor/evershop-feature",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Feature description",
  "keywords": ["evershop", "extension"],
  "author": "Your Name",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/vendor/evershop-feature"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@evershop/evershop": "^1.0.0"
  }
}
```

### 2. Add README.md

```markdown
# EverShop Feature

Description of your extension.

## Installation

\`\`\`bash
npm install @vendor/evershop-feature
\`\`\`

## Configuration

Add to `config/default.json`:
\`\`\`json
{
  "system": {
    "extensions": [
      {
        "name": "feature",
        "resolve": "node_modules/@vendor/evershop-feature",
        "enabled": true
      }
    ]
  }
}
\`\`\`
```

### 3. Publish

```bash
npm publish --access public
```

